    {
        "content": "<p>It isn't as fancy as <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"989743\">@Jack McCarthy</span> 's website, but I've made two PRs to CI: <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/43406\">#43406</a> and <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib-ci/pull/68\">this one in mathlib-ci</a>, that will post a comment with a table with the resolved urls and declarations to PRs adding new tags, so it should be much easier to review them going forwards. Also I've made a <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/leanprover-community.github.io/pull/909\">PR to add a paragraph about tags</a> on the website, since they weren't documented anywhere.</p>\n<p>(this is a not-so-subtle prod to anyone that wants to review them : )</p>",
